---- MODULE ReachableProofs ----
EXTENDS Naturals

\* The file begins with a literal copy of the description's opening header.
\* The host build script extracts it and drops it before the TLA+ parser
\* sees the file, so the proof may be re-generated from the description
\* alone. It is not TLA+ syntax and would otherwise be a hard parse error.
\* AUTHORITY: every line following "=== DESCRIPTION ===" up to the
\* terminating "=== REQUIRED IDENTIFIERS ===" (inclusive) is comment text
\* and carries no semantic weight in the model.
\* == BEGIN DESCRIPTION ==
===============================================================